466
00:20:52,376 --> 00:20:54,544
"Justin, you need to be more serious."

467
00:20:54,670 --> 00:20:56,380
Well, I don't know. Life's really short.

468
00:20:56,463 --> 00:20:58,340
You don't have to take everything
so seriously.

469
00:20:58,423 --> 00:21:00,926
I feel maybe you took things seriously
for a very long time...

470
00:21:01,009 --> 00:21:03,053
-Mmm.
-...and now you're finally having fun.

471
00:21:03,136 --> 00:21:04,012
Yeah.

472
00:21:05,013 --> 00:21:06,848
Be honest, would you do this again?

473
00:21:07,849 --> 00:21:09,643
Yeah, I mean, it was fun.

474
00:21:09,726 --> 00:21:11,687
You have this personality that...

475
00:21:12,271 --> 00:21:15,440
-I've never encountered.
-[laughs]

476
00:21:15,524 --> 00:21:17,109
What personality is that?

477
00:21:17,234 --> 00:21:20,779
I've never met somebody
that's a hundred percent open as to...

478
00:21:20,988 --> 00:21:21,822
[chuckles]

479
00:21:21,905 --> 00:21:24,700
"This is who I am from the get-go."

480
00:21:26,702 --> 00:21:28,745
-Oh, my goodness! We're here?
-[driver] This is your stop.

481
00:21:29,538 --> 00:21:32,082
-It was amazing meeting you. For sure.
-It was nice to meet you.

482
00:21:32,165 --> 00:21:34,042
-Have a great night.
-Same to you.

483
00:21:34,710 --> 00:21:36,628
-See ya.
-See ya. Have a good one.

484
00:21:37,713 --> 00:21:38,755
[Exhales]

485
00:21:39,840 --> 00:21:41,633
I don't remember the last time I prayed,

486
00:21:41,717 --> 00:21:45,137
but I've also never been more willing
to pray in my life.

487
00:21:45,429 --> 00:21:47,681
-If we're being real.
-Oh.

488
00:21:47,764 --> 00:21:49,516
I hope that no matter what happens,

489
00:21:49,599 --> 00:21:53,270
that you get something
from this encounter with me.

490
00:21:53,353 --> 00:21:56,648
You just never know who God has for you.

491
00:21:57,107 --> 00:21:58,942
I never thought I would go on a date

492
00:21:59,026 --> 00:22:01,695
where I had no idea what the person
was like or what they looked like,

493
00:22:01,778 --> 00:22:04,740
-and actually enjoyed it as much as I did.
-[laughs]

494
00:22:04,823 --> 00:22:07,159
No, I really enjoyed it.
This has been so nice.

495
00:22:08,827 --> 00:22:12,080
Do you plan on having a family
or kids anytime soon?

496
00:22:12,581 --> 00:22:16,877
I am not in any rush to have kids
or get married.

497
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:19,671
It's definitely all about the right place
and the right time.

498
00:22:22,549 --> 00:22:23,633
I had a good time.

499
00:22:23,717 --> 00:22:24,551
Did you?

500
00:22:24,718 --> 00:22:26,386
-[laughs] Honestly, I did.
-I'm glad.

501
00:22:26,470 --> 00:22:27,763
You're a fun person.

502
00:22:27,846 --> 00:22:31,308
And it was better than what I thought
it was going to be.

503
00:22:32,392 --> 00:22:34,186
I'd love to get your number
before we leave.

504
00:22:34,269 --> 00:22:35,103
Yeah. Absolutely.

505
00:22:36,938 --> 00:22:37,939
But yeah. No...

506
00:22:38,023 --> 00:22:41,026
I'll call you and I appreciate you coming.

507
00:22:41,109 --> 00:22:42,694
All right, text me.

508
00:22:43,278 --> 00:22:45,530
-I will. Will do.
-Give me a call. [giggles]

509
00:22:45,614 --> 00:22:47,491
-All right. Have a good night, bye.
-Same to you.

510
00:22:47,574 --> 00:22:48,575
-Bye.
-Bye.

511
00:22:52,329 --> 00:22:54,039
-I appreciate you.
-Bye.

512
00:22:54,122 --> 00:22:56,416
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
I will let you out this side.

513
00:22:56,500 --> 00:22:58,126
Okay. Thank you.

514
00:23:02,297 --> 00:23:04,966
[grunts, exhales]

515
00:23:30,784 --> 00:23:34,663
["Run With The Sun" by Nick Kingsley
and Hannah Hart playing]

516
00:23:50,095 --> 00:23:51,847
♪ To run with the sun... ♪

517
00:23:51,930 --> 00:23:53,223
-Hi!
-[Justin] How are you?

518
00:23:53,306 --> 00:23:54,266
[Ann] How are you?

519
00:23:55,642 --> 00:23:57,519
Ann, it's good to see you again.

520
00:23:57,602 --> 00:23:58,520
Nice to see you.

521
00:23:58,603 --> 00:23:59,980
So, I have a question.

522
00:24:00,063 --> 00:24:02,399
-Have you ever been to the museum?
-I have not.

523
00:24:02,482 --> 00:24:03,567
Isn't that crazy?

524
00:24:03,650 --> 00:24:05,152
[laughs] That's so bad!

525
00:24:05,235 --> 00:24:07,988
-That's not terrible, I've heard worse.
-I've been to the other ones.

526
00:24:08,071 --> 00:24:09,614
-I just haven't been over here.
-I've heard worse.

527
00:24:09,698 --> 00:24:12,159
-Would you be down for that?
-Yeah. Is that what you want to do?

528
00:24:12,242 --> 00:24:15,662
I have two tickets,
so it's already been planned. [chuckles]

529
00:24:16,204 --> 00:24:17,539
I love your shoes, though.

530
00:24:17,622 --> 00:24:19,332
-Aren't these fun? Thank you.
-I really do.

531
00:24:19,416 --> 00:24:20,417
They're actually Converse.

532
00:24:20,500 --> 00:24:23,462
♪ To run with the sun ♪

533
00:24:29,384 --> 00:24:33,305
♪ Run with the sun ♪

534
00:24:46,860 --> 00:24:51,072
♪ Run with the sun ♪

